{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"58bf091ad9c5a366796993a34c6965c1ab0f6f8168417dfcdef1b5e0ec45c3af","ja":"ひなたのナレーション","zh":"阳光的旁白","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"93cce0f6e940b0ecab411fe28f9b6a6585c349fcc6926ce91b2d27f3adaeab09","ja":"そうして迎えた、映画とプラネタリウムの\nコラボイベント当日……。","zh":"就这样迎来了电影与天文馆\n联动活动的当天……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d8f62ff0a3cbb6ce4666f91d0292e2d46a90c58e808bb96fc151cd0ea1721444","ja":"「冥界の入り口まで振り返らなければ、\nエウリュディケを返すと約束されましたが……」","zh":"“对方答应过我，只要在抵达冥界入口前不回头，\n就会把欧律狄刻还给我，但是……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8c0298c5c046295bd827ed9e8cc1a9a590257ece400e6ea73087425079232d86","ja":"「最後の最後になって……うぅ。オルフェウスは\n振り返り……妻を、永遠に……失って、しまうのです」","zh":"「到了最后关头……呜呜。俄耳甫斯\n回过了头……永远地……失去了、他的妻子」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1bbc628b11b4c42abb17aced5656860f8125f01145a69ef634aa6af66016d294","ja":"ふぅ……結局途中から\n泣いてしまったよぉ。あれ？","zh":"呼……结果后半截还是\n哭出来了呢。咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"04965d6f31009c533ca8df370d6958a5bac909ec0ad30b88b0925a9f26263c5b","ja":"うぅ……ひなたちゃん、お疲れさま。\nすごくよかったわよ……！","zh":"呜呜……日向，辛苦了。\n真的很棒哦……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"083be8471237c8f82324d54097bbfacc8b8515255d020f4b7975c751c56080e4","ja":"な、なんでこのみさんが泣いてるんだい！？","zh":"怎、怎么连木美小姐都哭了啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"de309349cc5b7ba269f18e28682c0adff778aa6dc59848c5a840bf7f9e92c62a","ja":"それだけ、ひなたちゃんのナレーションが、\n心に迫ってくるものだったからですよ～。","zh":"那是因为，日向的旁白，\n真的很打动人心呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"168003b838b46d0c8b3241f7aa07022dbaca434c1f10bff35fac3299726ddadd","ja":"ひなたちゃんの声で、光景がはっきり浮かんできて……\n姫も思わず、涙ぐんでしまったのです。","zh":"日向的声音让眼前的景象清晰浮现……\n连公主也忍不住热泪盈眶了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"8a974690c66f3593fff750ea15c2d31c16d4a92e4158e20806ab7bc514c65610","ja":"会場のお客さんも、切なそうに星空を見上げていたわ。\nあ、でも……最後は、微笑んでいたかも。","zh":"现场的观众们，也神情伤感地仰望着星空呢。\n啊，不过……最后，或许露出了微笑吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"4f4c4c582f9eba9ddb7dac78d38d7e8cda7fcea6a1d129155989f5ab3f560533","ja":"ひなたちゃんの優しい声が響いたからなのです。\nきっとみんなも、優しい気持ちになったのですよ。","zh":"是因为响起了日向温柔的声音。\n大家的心情一定也变得温柔起来了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"dac34e595e73c646281a3352b468a7c3c4da25f72c019e2fa432db4797f2647a","ja":"涙しながらも、最後は優しい微笑みで終わる……\nとても素晴らしいナレーションでした～。","zh":"一边流着泪，最后却以温柔的微笑收尾……\n真是非常精彩的旁白解说呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"277e4527d5f4d37e2be5461b6706587462971f86dac26c31446f1bf8af0006c2","ja":"ええ。お姉さんも、すっかり入り込んじゃったわ♪","zh":"是啊。连姐姐我都完全沉浸其中了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"40c88a0b3cfef5b3bc0573e346b61f1d0ba498e9675e3ea60849e02651078d48","ja":"そっか……みんなありがとねぇ。\nあたし、最後までやれてよかったよぉ……！","zh":"是吗……谢谢大家啊。\n我能坚持到最后，真是太好了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"9f1e755a138c16bb7f6fafac638e6a6fbdb37626499a4b27b9a4015852927f22","ja":"「……そんな悲しい物語ですが、オルフェウスに\n贈られたたて琴は……星座となって、輝いています」","zh":"「……虽然是个悲伤的故事，但赠予俄耳甫斯的\n里拉琴……化作了星座，闪耀着光芒。」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1235.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"6f5eed13fcd508ce2a6276379b4414716b461414061d04fb6abcee24fdafaf46","ja":"「あたしは……こと座を見るたびに、\nこの物語を思い出すと思います。何度も、何度も」","zh":"「我……每次看到天琴座，\n都会想起这个故事。一次又一次，一次又一次。」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
